### Get all tasks
GET http://localhost:5187/tasks


### Existing task
GET http://localhost:5187/tasks/2


### Missing task
GET http://localhost:5187/tasks/999




#####################




########################
### PUT existing task
PUT http://localhost:5187/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "title": "Updated controller task",
  "isCompleted": false
}

### GET updated task
GET http://localhost:5187/tasks/2

### DELETE existing task
DELETE http://localhost:5187/tasks/3

### DELETE same task again
DELETE http://localhost:5187/tasks/3




#####################




########################



### Complete task
PATCH http://localhost:5187/tasks/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}

### Verify
GET http://localhost:5187/tasks/2

### Missing task
PATCH http://localhost:5187/tasks/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isCompleted": true
}




