### 1. GET all products
GET http://localhost:5187/products


### 2. GET products where inStock = true
GET http://localhost:5187/products?inStock=true


### 3. GET products where inStock = false
GET http://localhost:5187/products?inStock=false


### 4. GET existing product by id
GET http://localhost:5187/products/1


### 5. GET missing product
GET http://localhost:5187/products/999


### 6. POST valid product
POST http://localhost:5187/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 4,
  "name": "Headphones",
  "price": 120,
  "inStock": true
}


### 7. POST invalid - empty name
POST http://localhost:5187/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "name": "",
  "price": 100,
  "inStock": true
}


### 8. POST invalid - negative price
POST http://localhost:5187/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 5,
  "name": "Invalid Product",
  "price": -10,
  "inStock": true
}


### 9. GET newly created product
GET http://localhost:5187/products/4


### 10. PUT existing product
PUT http://localhost:5187/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "name": "Updated Monitor",
  "price": 350,
  "inStock": false
}


### 11. Verify PUT
### Important: returned/saved id should still be 2, not 999
GET http://localhost:5187/products/2


### 12. PUT missing product
PUT http://localhost:5187/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 999,
  "name": "Missing Product",
  "price": 200,
  "inStock": true
}


### 13. PUT invalid - empty name
PUT http://localhost:5187/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "",
  "price": 350,
  "inStock": true
}


### 14. PUT invalid - negative price
PUT http://localhost:5187/products/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "name": "Monitor",
  "price": -50,
  "inStock": true
}


### 15. PATCH existing product - change stock status
PATCH http://localhost:5187/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inStock": false
}


### 16. Verify PATCH
GET http://localhost:5187/products/1


### 17. PATCH it back
PATCH http://localhost:5187/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inStock": true
}


### 18. PATCH missing product
PATCH http://localhost:5187/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "inStock": false
}


### 19. DELETE existing product
DELETE http://localhost:5187/products/3


### 20. DELETE same product again
DELETE http://localhost:5187/products/3


### 21. GET final product list
GET http://localhost:5187/products








